endent earning opportunity, even though the video also displays a loss disclaimer.", "fine_grained_rationale": "S06 fits because the promoted mechanism is explicitly described as a matrix project and the call to action routes viewers through a sharing person and team-based joining process. The supplied frames do not establish a completed loss or specify exact commission percentages, but they do show promotion of participation in a multi-person recruitment structure rather than merely neutral commentary.", "evidence": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "observation": "The frame states: \"OVER 2,000 PEOPLE ARE JOINING THE FORSAGE PROJECT WORLDWIDE EVERY SINGLE DAY!\" over a world map with multiple person images, using social proof to promote broad participation.", "source_id": "F0015", "quote": ""}, {"evidence_id": "E002", "observation": "The frame displays \"YOU NEED TO PUT IN THE EFFORT\" above a grid of Ethereum coins, connecting participation effort with the promoted financial opportunity.", "source_id": "F0028", "quote": ""}, {"evidence_id": "E003", "observation": "The frame instructs viewers to \"CONTACT THE PERSON WHO SHARED WITH YOU THIS VIDEO,\" establishing a person-to-person referral and recruitment pathway.", "source_id": "F0045", "quote": ""}, {"evidence_id": "E004", "observation": "The frame identifies Forsage and describes it as \"THE FIRST EVER 100% DECENTRALIZED MATRIX PROJECT!\"", "source_id": "F0050", "quote": ""}, {"evidence_id": "E005", "observation": "The description supplies a Forsage referral URL, providing a direct destination for participation in the promoted project.", "source_id": "DESCRIPTION_0001", "quote": "For more information visit this page: https://forsage.io/i/9fkp6i/"}]}}
